# Progressive Development of Deep Learning Skills through Undergraduate and Postgraduate Dissertations.

**Authors:** James, Philip

## Abstract
Examines dissertation requirements and assessment procedures in 10 environment-related undergraduate and postgraduate programs using a &quot;framework&quot; approach. Hypothesizes that each level should reveal differences in development of deep thought. Finds that each dissertation occupies a distinct place along a progressive development of a deep learning style. (DSK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ588734

